msgid "内核模块的系统管理"
msgstr "System Administration of Kernel Modules"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 的可加载模块采用 Linux 风格的 Kconfig、Kbuild、ELF ``.ko`` 和 模块管理命令。模块必须针对正在使用的 "
"ReliefNT 内核重新编译；这不表示 Linux 原版二进制模块或其全部内核内部 API 可直接使用。POSIX 不定义 "
"内核模块格式，用户态系统调用遵循已实现的 Linux x86_64 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT loadable modules use Linux-style Kconfig, Kbuild, ELF ``.ko`` "
"files, and module management commands. Modules must be rebuilt for the "
"ReliefNT kernel in use; this does not mean that original Linux binary "
"modules or all Linux internal kernel APIs can be used directly. POSIX does "
"not define a kernel module format. Userspace system calls follow the "
"implemented Linux x86_64 ABI."

msgid "构建配置"
msgstr "Build Configuration"

msgid "从 ReliefOS 根目录执行::"
msgstr "Run from the ReliefOS root directory::"

msgid ""
"``defconfig`` 明确重置 OS 和对应内核的配置，默认生产组件均为内置 ``y``。 在内核菜单中可将有独立生命周期的部件改为 "
"``m``；调度、内存、模块加载器 和 VFS 等启动核心保持内置。``kernel-allmodconfig`` 将可模块化部件选为 m； "
"``kernel-olddefconfig`` 同步已有内核配置。普通构建不会把 m 偷改回 y。 关闭 ``CONFIG_MODULES`` "
"时仍可生成全内置系统。"
msgstr ""
"``defconfig`` explicitly resets both OS and corresponding kernel "
"configurations; all default production components are built in as ``y``. In "
"the kernel menu, components with independent lifecycles can be changed to "
"``m``; boot-critical components such as scheduling, memory, the module "
"loader, and VFS remain built in. ``kernel-allmodconfig`` selects m for "
"modularizable components; ``kernel-olddefconfig`` synchronizes an existing "
"kernel configuration. Normal builds do not silently change m back to y. "
"Disabling ``CONFIG_MODULES`` still allows a fully built-in system."

msgid ""
"模块与 initramfs 消费内核实际 install manifest。镜像打包检查根控制器、 根文件系统及其依赖闭包，拒绝缺失必需功能、模块错 "
"ABI 或成对载荷不一致， 不会为让构建成功而静默修改配置。产物位置沿用 :doc:`../kbuild/building`。"
msgstr ""
"Modules and initramfs use the kernel's actual install manifest. Image "
"packaging checks the root controller, root filesystem, and their dependency "
"closure, rejecting missing required functionality, module ABI mismatches, or"
" inconsistent paired payloads. It does not silently alter configuration to "
"make a build succeed. Artifact locations remain as described in "
":doc:`../kbuild/building`."

msgid "启动与自动加载"
msgstr "Boot and Automatic Loading"

msgid ""
"GRUB 同时加载内核和薄 newc initramfs。``/init`` 挂载 proc/sys/dev，使用 真实 BusyBox "
"modprobe 加载根控制器和文件系统，再根据 ``root=`` 挂载真实根 并 switch_root。Live/Installer "
"的大根镜像是独立的内存块设备，不能替代 initramfs。普通 OpenRC 模块服务先于音频、网络和 Xorg；PCI 设备通过 sysfs "
"modalias 选择模块，平台模块来自当前内核版本的生成清单。"
msgstr ""
"GRUB loads both the kernel and a thin newc initramfs. ``/init`` mounts "
"proc/sys/dev, uses real BusyBox modprobe to load the root controller and "
"filesystem, then mounts the real root according to ``root=`` and runs "
"switch_root. The large Live/Installer root image is a separate in-memory "
"block device and cannot replace initramfs. The regular OpenRC module service"
" runs before audio, networking, and Xorg. PCI devices select modules through"
" sysfs modalias; platform modules come from a generated manifest for the "
"current kernel version."

msgid ""
"管理员可使用 ``/etc/modules-load.d/*.conf`` 和 ``/etc/modprobe.d/*.conf``。 "
"同名配置的覆盖、屏蔽、blacklist 和参数由实际模块工具与加载策略处理。 不要把旧内核版本的生成平台清单复制成所有版本共享的静态配置。"
msgstr ""
"Administrators can use ``/etc/modules-load.d/*.conf`` and "
"``/etc/modprobe.d/*.conf``. Overrides and masking of same-name "
"configuration, blacklists, and parameters are handled by the actual module "
"tools and loading policy. Do not copy a generated platform manifest from an "
"old kernel version into a static configuration shared by all versions."

msgid "查询与装卸"
msgstr "Inspection, Loading, and Unloading"

msgid "在目标 ReliefOS 系统内执行::"
msgstr "Run on the target ReliefOS system::"

msgid ""
"模块安装在 ``/lib/modules/<uname -r>/``。modprobe 读取目标兼容 depmod "
"生成的依赖、别名和内置数据库；内置模块的 modprobe 是有效的空操作。 修改内核模块需要内核检查的 ``CAP_SYS_MODULE``，仅在 "
"UI 中获得管理员 身份不能绕过该检查。错误版本、未解析符号和损坏 ELF 必须明确失败。"
msgstr ""
"Modules are installed under ``/lib/modules/<uname -r>/``. modprobe reads "
"dependency, alias, and built-in databases generated by a target-compatible "
"depmod; modprobe for a built-in module is a valid no-op. Modifying kernel "
"modules requires ``CAP_SYS_MODULE``, as checked by the kernel; merely "
"obtaining administrator identity in the UI cannot bypass this check. Wrong "
"versions, unresolved symbols, and corrupted ELF files must fail explicitly."

msgid ""
"活跃挂载、打开的设备、用户映射、IRQ、DMA 和在途回调会保留模块 owner。 卸载忙碌的根磁盘、文件系统、DRM 或 PCM "
"实现被拒绝属于正常行为。 不能为了让卸载命令返回成功而释放仍在使用的代码。"
msgstr ""
"Active mounts, open devices, user mappings, IRQs, DMA, and in-flight "
"callbacks retain the module owner. Refusal to unload a busy root disk, "
"filesystem, DRM, or PCM implementation is normal. Code still in use must not"
" be freed merely to make an unload command succeed."

msgid "更新与恢复"
msgstr "Updates and Recovery"

msgid ""
"签名内核包及 RPR 的完整事务见 :doc:`packages`。A/B 选择记录绑定完整 模块 ABI、内核 SHA-256 和 initramfs"
" SHA-256；版本目录还包含成对清单。 首次安装的残缺零分配或同一候选版本记录可重试，不明旧记录不会被覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"For complete signed kernel package and RPR transactions, see "
":doc:`packages`. A/B selection records bind the full module ABI, kernel "
"SHA-256, and initramfs SHA-256; version directories also contain paired "
"manifests. An incomplete all-zero allocation from a first installation or a "
"record for the same candidate version can be retried; unknown old records "
"are not overwritten."

msgid ""
"故障模型包括任一步写入/同步失败、未同步数据或目录条目丢失，以及非当前 选择记录撕裂。同步成功的数据被设备丢弃、任意 FAT 元数据损坏，以及更新 "
"MBR/EFI 固件加载器本体，超出日常内核包 A/B 发布的保证范围。 QEMU、VMware 和真实硬件的运行证据分别记录，不能互相替代。"
msgstr ""
"The fault model includes write/sync failure at any step, loss of unsynced "
"data or directory entries, and tearing of the noncurrent selection record. A"
" device discarding successfully synced data, arbitrary FAT metadata "
"corruption, and updates to the MBR/EFI firmware loader itself are outside "
"the guarantees of routine kernel-package A/B publishing. Runtime evidence "
"for QEMU, VMware, and physical hardware is recorded separately and cannot "
"substitute for one another."

msgid "固件选择器的回归测试使用独立、无可执行内核的 ISO，在真实 BIOS 和 UEFI GRUB 中检查摘要参数、成对载荷和回退选择::"
msgstr ""
"Firmware selector regression tests use an independent ISO without an "
"executable kernel to check digest arguments, paired payloads, and fallback "
"selection in real BIOS and UEFI GRUB::"

msgid ""
"先在同一 ``--stage`` 构建 ``grub-host grub-efi``，输出目录必须尚不存在。 GRUB 的本地补丁为上游 "
"``hashsum`` 增加单文件 ``--expected`` 比对；选择器 独立验证内核和 initramfs "
"的实际字节，避免把缺项校验清单当作载荷验证。 升级内核包不替换固件加载器；更新此选择器时，必须同时安装同版 BIOS/EFI GRUB "
"模块，不能仅复制新的配置文件到旧版 GRUB。"
msgstr ""
"First build ``grub-host grub-efi`` with the same ``--stage``; the output "
"directory must not already exist. The local GRUB patch adds single-file "
"``--expected`` comparison to upstream ``hashsum``. The selector "
"independently verifies the actual bytes of the kernel and initramfs, "
"avoiding the mistake of treating an incomplete checksum list as payload "
"verification. Kernel package upgrades do not replace the firmware loader. "
"When updating this selector, install matching BIOS/EFI GRUB modules too; do "
"not merely copy a new configuration file to an old GRUB version."

msgid "内核内部机制、模块开发和构建 SDK 由 ReliefNT 手册持有；本页只说明 ReliefOS 配置、包管理及启动策略。"
msgstr ""
"The ReliefNT manual owns documentation of kernel internals, module "
"development, and the build SDK; this page covers only ReliefOS "
"configuration, package management, and boot policy."
